<title>UK: Merrill sets range warrants on Roche Holding AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets range warrants on Roche Holding AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued five million dual range daycount warrants on Roche Holding AG Genusscheine.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.20 CHF (INDICATIVE)</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.JUN.97	     PAYDATE   03.OCT.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9265 CHF		LISTING   SWISS EXCHANGE</p>
<p> NOTES	     RANGE FOR DAILY CREDIT OF CHF 0.05319 IS</p>
<p>		     9000 CHF TO 10000 CHF.</p>
<p>		     MAX PAYOUT IS 10 CHF. MAX YIELD IS 355 PCT.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
